globalThis.STORY_ZW_PAL_EN=Object.assign(globalThis.STORY_ZW_PAL_EN||{},{
'疾厄':{
'紫微':{title:"An emperor's body: holding the fort can wear you out",story:"With Zi Wei in your Health palace, your basic constitution is usually decent, and when you're unwell there's often someone to look after you. Zi Wei belongs to the Earth element, so keep an eye on your stomach and digestion. Much of your stress comes from feeling “I have to hold it together,” so you hide discomfort and only admit it once you're exhausted.",scenes:["After several days chairing meetings you look full of energy, but at home you've lost your appetite and just want to lie down in silence.","You might keep a date even with a cold, because calling in sick or canceling feels like losing face."],advice:"Put health checkups in your calendar as real appointments. Your body is a subject in your kingdom that deserves good care too."},
'紫微·天府':{title:"A full granary that's easy to overfill",story:"With Zi Wei and Tian Fu together in your Health palace, you have a solid constitution and good resilience, a fairly steady placement. Both stars belong to Earth, so your digestion and moderation in eating are the main things to watch. You know how to enjoy yourself and how to endure, and stress often turns into a lavish dinner.",scenes:["After wrapping a big project you reward yourself with a feast, and the next day your stomach feels a bit too full.","You might rarely get sick, so your checkup results stay unopened until the end of the year."],advice:"Eat well, but also eat just enough: stop dinner at about seventy percent full, and get your annual checkup on schedule."},
'紫微·天相':{title:"Pressure quietly builds under a polished surface",story:"With Zi Wei and Tian Xiang in your Health palace, things are generally steady. You care about looking well groomed and are willing to put effort into self-care. Keep an eye on your digestion and your skin. Your stress mostly comes from smoothing things over between people: you protect everyone's dignity, and your own feelings end up with nowhere to go.",scenes:["You step in when colleagues argue, it ends well, and that night your skin breaks out in a rash or spots.","You might be very particular about skincare, yet often stay up late answering messages."],advice:"Self-care starts with sleep. Keep one evening a week free of other people's problems."},
'紫微·破軍':{title:"Energy like an erupting volcano, with a cool-down needed",story:"With Zi Wei and Po Jun in your Health palace, your energy comes in bursts: you often charge through something in one go and then collapse. Po Jun carries a sense of depletion, so watch for stomach trouble after overwork and keep an eye on your urinary system. Your stress comes from constantly wanting to change and break through, and your body can struggle to keep up with your mind.",scenes:["Once you decide to move, you pack the whole place in one weekend and spend the next three days with an aching back.","You might sign up for a marathon on impulse and run it after only a few weeks of training."],advice:"Build rest days into any new plan, and give yourself a regular recovery period after every sprint."},
'紫微·七殺':{title:"A general's body, used to pushing through pain",story:"With Zi Wei and Qi Sha in your Health palace, you're usually sturdy and strong willed, and you recover quickly when ill. Keep an eye on your respiratory system and on strains from exercise. Your stress comes from a heavy sense of responsibility; you always feel you have to carry everything yourself, and your body is often the last thing you think of.",scenes:["At the gym you always want to add another plate, until one day your shoulder suddenly locks up.","You might still be running meetings with a sore throat, only stopping once your voice goes hoarse."],advice:"Warm up properly before exercise, and say so when you're tired. Admitting it won't cost you your authority."},
'紫微·貪狼':{title:"The king of pleasure needs to manage the appetite",story:"With Zi Wei and Tan Lang in your Health palace, you're full of vitality and love good food, good wine and a lively crowd. Keep an eye on the load on your liver and kidneys, and on keeping regular hours. You often relieve stress with a big meal or a night out. It works in the moment, but over time your body has to pay it back slowly.",scenes:["You never miss a late-night snack run with friends, and coffee gets you through the next morning.","Once a holiday starts, you might binge shows past midnight several nights in a row and feel especially tired when it ends."],advice:"Enjoy yourself, but set a baseline, such as being in bed before midnight at least four nights a week."},
'天機':{title:"A mind that won't stop spinning needs rested nerves",story:"With Tian Ji in your Health palace, your body is sensitive and responsive: often your mind tenses first and your body follows. Keep an eye on nervous tension, your liver and gallbladder, and your joints and limbs. {{B:天機:You adjust well to pressure.|Overthinking can more easily keep you from sleeping well.}}",scenes:["The night before a presentation you rehearse it in your head over and over and lie awake for two hours.","You might get so busy you forget lunch, and only notice in the evening that your hands are a little shaky and your head feels tight."],advice:"Half an hour before bed, write your to-do list on paper so your brain knows it can clock off for the day."},
'天機·太陰':{title:"Thoughts under moonlight: sensitive and prone to sleeplessness",story:"With Tian Ji and Tai Yin in your Health palace, you're very sensitive to change: weather, routine and mood all show up in your body. Keep an eye on sleep quality, hormonal balance and nervous tension. You don't talk much about stress and tend to work through it alone late at night.",scenes:["When the seasons change, you feel tired sooner than others and your body's rhythm goes off for a while.","You might wake in the night, start replaying something someone said that day, and be unable to get back to sleep."],advice:"Keep a fixed bedtime, dim the lights in your bedroom and put your phone where you can't reach it from bed."},
'天機·巨門':{title:"Your brain and your mouth both working overtime",story:"With Tian Ji and Ju Men in your Health palace, you think fast and talk a lot, and stress often settles in your stomach and nerves. Keep an eye on digestion, your mouth, and nervous tension. You tend to grow suspicious of small changes in your body, and looking things up online only makes you more anxious.",scenes:["When work gets stuck, your stomach knots up while you hunt for a solution, and you put lunch down after two bites.","Your throat might feel a little off, and you start searching every possible cause, getting more nervous the more you read."],advice:"If something about your body worries you, book an appointment and ask. Hand it to a professional rather than guessing online."},
'天機·天梁':{title:"The sage who worries for everyone needs self-care too",story:"With Tian Ji and Tian Liang in your Health palace, you think things through carefully for others but are more casual with yourself. Keep an eye on your liver and gallbladder, nervous tension and digestion. Luckily Tian Liang carries a sense of protection, so minor problems are usually caught and dealt with early.",scenes:["When a family member feels unwell, you're the first to research and go with them to the doctor, while your own stiff neck and shoulders go untreated.","You might know a lot about healthy living and explain it brilliantly to friends, yet often stay up late yourself."],advice:"Follow the advice you give others, starting with a twenty-minute walk every day."},
'太陽':{title:"A burning lamp: remember to adjust the brightness",story:"With Tai Yang in your Health palace, your energy flows outward. You love helping people and often get so busy you forget to rest. Keep an eye on your eyes, your head, your heart and your blood pressure. {{B:太陽:You have plenty of vitality and bounce back fast.|You can more easily run your battery down through quiet giving.}}",scenes:["After staring at a screen all day, your eyes are dry and your head feels tight by evening, and you still want to finish one last thing.","You might show up the moment a friend asks for help moving, haul heavy things all day, and only then realize you're worn out too."],advice:"For every hour of screen time, look into the distance for five minutes, and get your blood pressure and eyesight checked regularly."},
'太陽·太陰':{title:"Sun and moon on shifts: a flipped schedule hits hardest",story:"With Tai Yang and Tai Yin together in your Health palace, your state rises and falls with your surroundings: sometimes you're full of energy, other times you tire easily. Keep an eye on your eyes, your sleep and your hormonal balance. Out in the world you're lively, but at home you can drain to empty in an instant, switching between two rhythms very quickly.",scenes:["You run around all day at the office, then feel wide awake at night and scroll your phone until the small hours.","You might find jet lag especially tough when you travel abroad and need several days to recover after you get back."],advice:"Keep your wake-up time fixed and get ten minutes of sunlight in the morning; falling asleep at night gets easier."},
'太陽·巨門':{title:"Sunlight in dark corners: talk, but rest too",story:"With Tai Yang and Ju Men in your Health palace, you talk a lot and use your head a lot, and your voice and stomach are often the first to say you're tired. Keep an eye on your mouth and throat, digestion and eyes. Your stress mostly comes from communicating: you want to make things clear and end up talking yourself hoarse.",scenes:["After three presentations in one day, your voice is raspy that night and you can't be bothered to chat even with family.","You might have a knotted stomach all night after an argument, still replaying which line you should have said better."],advice:"Carry a bottle of warm water, and on talk-heavy days keep some quiet time in the evening without speaking."},
'太陽·天梁':{title:"A sun that looks after the whole world shouldn't forget itself",story:"With Tai Yang and Tian Liang in your Health palace, you have a natural passion for caring for others, and your energy often goes into running around for them. Keep an eye on your heart and circulation, your eyes and your digestion. Tian Liang's protection means small scares usually pass without harm, but that's no reason to keep overdrawing.",scenes:["A colleague asks you to look over some documents, you stay up to finish, and the next day your eyes are bloodshot.","You might be the one in the family who takes the elders to the doctor, yet you haven't had your own checkup in years."],advice:"When you take a family member to the doctor, book an appointment for yourself as well. Look after your own capital before you look after others."},
'武曲':{title:"Metal-like toughness that needs protection from rust",story:"With Wu Qu in your Health palace, you're strong willed and work hard, and when ill you often grit your teeth and push through. Wu Qu belongs to the Metal element, so keep an eye on your airways, lungs and nose. Your stress is mostly tied to money and responsibility, and when tense you hold your breath without noticing and your shoulders go rigid.",scenes:["Doing the month-end accounts, you sit for three hours straight and stand up to find your neck and shoulders locked into one piece.","Your nose might act up with allergies every time the seasons change, yet you think it's too minor to see a doctor about."],advice:"Take a few deep breaths each day and let your shoulders drop, and look after your airways when the seasons turn."},
'武曲·天府':{title:"A solid vault: your body needs regular stocktaking too",story:"With Wu Qu and Tian Fu in your Health palace, your constitution is steady and your resistance usually good. Keep an eye on your airways and digestion. You're a good planner and tend to put your energy into earning and saving, so taking care of your body often gets treated as an expense that can wait.",scenes:["You compare membership fees at three gyms, and then never actually sign up.","When work gets busy you might eat out all the time and eat fast, often feeling bloated afterward."],advice:"Treat health as a long-term investment: budget every year for a checkup and exercise, with no discounts."},
'武曲·天相':{title:"A meticulous body needs a gap to loosen up",story:"With Wu Qu and Tian Xiang in your Health palace, you follow the rules and hold high standards, and your body often tenses under the pressure. Keep an eye on your airways, skin and urinary system. You're used to getting everything exactly right, yet rarely leave room for your own fatigue.",scenes:["Before a deadline you check and recheck until late at night, and the next day your skin turns dry and itchy or breaks out.","You might rarely get up for water at work and realize after hours that you drank only one glass all day."],advice:"Keep a big water bottle on your desk and get up once an hour to drink and stretch."},
'武曲·七殺':{title:"An iron will in a body of flesh",story:"With Wu Qu and Qi Sha in your Health palace, you have strong drive and stamina but often ignore your body when you're working. Keep an eye on your airways, your bones and joints, and accidental bumps during exercise or hands-on work. Your stress comes from high goals, and you often discover only after a sprint that your body is already overdrawn.",scenes:["You don't like asking for help moving heavy things, so you carry them alone and the next day your back is too sore to bend.","You might move quickly when working, and often nick your hand when chopping vegetables or fixing things."],advice:"Warm up before physical work, slow down for anything risky, and ask when you need an extra pair of hands."},
'武曲·破軍':{title:"A building site that keeps getting torn down: pace your energy",story:"With Wu Qu and Po Jun in your Health palace, your life swings between highs and lows, and your energy use rises and falls with it. Keep an eye on your airways, urinary system and overwork. Your stress is often tied to financial changes, and when you're tense you sleep badly and eat at odd times.",scenes:["During a job change, you're handing over work and interviewing at once, with irregular meals for weeks.","You might suddenly start intense workouts, keep it up for two weeks, then stop completely."],advice:"Aim for steady rather than intense with exercise and routine: thirty minutes a day beats one all-out session a week."},
'武曲·貪狼':{title:"Busy earning, busy playing: your body needs a curfew",story:"With Wu Qu and Tan Lang in your Health palace, you have lots of energy and strong appetites, and you throw yourself into both work and play. Keep an eye on your airways, the load on your liver and kidneys, and your sleep schedule. You often release stress through business dinners or treating yourself, which works short term but builds up fatigue over time.",scenes:["After closing a deal, you take everyone out for drinks and get home at two in the morning.","You might work flat out all week, then pack your weekend so full that Monday feels even more tiring."],advice:"Set a time to leave business dinners, and keep one weekend day completely unplanned."},
'天同':{title:"The blessing star presides; the risk is too much comfort",story:"With Tian Tong in your Health palace, your body is usually lucky: minor ailments come and go quickly. Keep an eye on your urinary system, water balance and weight. Stress rarely shows on your face; instead it turns into wanting to eat or lie down, and too much comfort for too long leaves your body feeling heavy.",scenes:["When you're down, you quietly open a delivery app and order a full-sugar bubble tea.","Once a holiday starts, you might spend all day on the sofa, and after three days your back is stiff."],advice:"Make exercise something fun. Walking or swimming with friends is easier to keep up than forcing yourself alone."},
'天同·太陰':{title:"Soft water that needs to keep flowing",story:"With Tian Tong and Tai Yin in your Health palace, your constitution is on the sensitive side, and when your emotions stir, your body reacts. Keep an eye on your urinary system, hormonal balance and sleep. You need a sense of safety, and under stress you tend to shut yourself away and let your routine slide.",scenes:["One comment from your boss, and you can't sleep that night and have no energy the next day.","As soon as the weather cools, your hands and feet might go cold, and only a hot drink makes you feel better."],advice:"Soak your feet or take a hot bath before bed to relax your body, and if something's on your mind, talk to someone about it."},
'天同·巨門':{title:"What weighs on your mind often ferments in your stomach first",story:"With Tian Tong and Ju Men in your Health palace, you look easygoing but often carry things inside. Keep an eye on digestion, your urinary system and your mouth. Your stress isn't loud, but it lasts: you may spend days replaying an unpleasant remark, and your body stays in a heavy, stuffy state.",scenes:["After a small misunderstanding with a friend, you say it's nothing, but for days nothing you eat seems to digest well.","You might need the bathroom whenever you're nervous, and make several extra trips before big occasions."],advice:"Write down what's weighing on you or talk it over, and eat more slowly so your stomach doesn't have to carry your emotions."},
'天同·天梁':{title:"A protected body still needs looking after",story:"With Tian Tong and Tian Liang in your Health palace, your body tends to have luck on its side, and small problems usually pass smoothly. Keep an eye on your urinary system, digestion and the minor chronic issues that come with age. You're mild natured and tend to dismiss your body's signals as nothing much.",scenes:["Your back has ached for a while, and you keep saying “a bit of rest will fix it,” until you finally see someone three months later.","You might love brewing tea and taking life slow, but often sit too long without moving."],advice:"If a minor problem lasts more than two weeks, see a doctor. Your good fortune is there to help you catch things early, not to let you ignore them."},
'廉貞':{title:"An inner fire that needs good ventilation",story:"With Lian Zhen in your Health palace, your emotions are intense and often smolder inside. Keep an eye on circulation, your heart and blood vessels, and your skin. You look calm, but stress often turns into insomnia, skin flare-ups or unexplained fatigue. Your body is more honest than your mouth.",scenes:["When you're misunderstood you say nothing, and a few days later your face breaks out.","You might still be turning over whether something was right or wrong after working late, and feel your heart beating a bit fast when you lie down."],advice:"Find a kind of exercise that makes you sweat and burns off the fire inside, and get your blood pressure and cholesterol checked regularly."},
'廉貞·天府':{title:"A steady hearth: watch for smoldering",story:"With Lian Zhen and Tian Fu in your Health palace, things are fairly steady overall; you know how to look after yourself and value quality. Keep an eye on digestion, circulation and moderation in eating. You mostly process stress on your own: you look composed, but inside you're often calculating and on guard.",scenes:["You pick good ingredients and cook for yourself, then get busy and eat takeout for a week straight.","You might rarely say when you feel unwell, until your family notices you look pale."],advice:"Keep your high standards for food, and exercise regularly so your circulation keeps up with your pace."},
'廉貞·天相':{title:"Pressure hidden within the rules",story:"With Lian Zhen and Tian Xiang in your Health palace, you value discipline and image, and your body often tenses from holding things in. Keep an eye on your skin, urinary system and circulation. You care about getting things right, so emotions get tucked away, and over time they surface through your body.",scenes:["Before the year-end review you organize paperwork every night, your skin starts to itch and your sleep gets lighter.","So as not to trouble anyone, you might push through a full day's schedule while feeling unwell."],advice:"Give yourself a slot where imperfection is allowed: once a week, do something purely relaxing, like a massage or a hot spring soak."},
'廉貞·七殺':{title:"A body that charges into battle must remember to retreat",story:"With Lian Zhen and Qi Sha in your Health palace, you're driven and tough, but you often overdo it. Keep an eye on circulation, your airways, and bumps and strains during exercise. Your stress comes from refusing to lose: the harder something is, the more you want to do it, and your body often pays the price.",scenes:["Hiking, you insist on reaching the summit, and your knees hurt for a week after you come down.","You might ride especially fast when you're running late, and that's how a minor scrape happens."],advice:"Leave yourself some margin in both exercise and commuting, and don't skimp on safety gear."},
'廉貞·破軍':{title:"Burning down and rebuilding both drain power",story:"With Lian Zhen and Po Jun in your Health palace, your life often goes through dramatic changes, and your body swings between good and bad with it. Keep an eye on circulation, your urinary system, and lowered immunity after overwork. Your stress comes from restlessness with the status quo, so you often push several things at once.",scenes:["Changing jobs while renovating your home, you catch one cold after another for half a year.","You might stay up all night to finish something and then crash and sleep an entire day."],advice:"In periods of change, pay special attention to sleep and regular meals, and push only one big thing at a time."},
'廉貞·貪狼':{title:"Lively nights need quiet mornings",story:"With Lian Zhen and Tan Lang in your Health palace, you love a crowd and love to indulge; life is colorful but easily thrown off balance. Keep an eye on the load on your liver and kidneys, circulation and sleep schedule. You often unwind through socializing and entertainment. You have a great time, but your body has to clean up slowly the next day.",scenes:["You hit two parties after work on Friday and still feel tired after sleeping until noon on Saturday.","You might pause your diet for one party, and the pause lasts a month."],advice:"Go to the party, but set a time and a limit for yourself, drink plenty of water when you get home and go to bed early."},
'天府':{title:"A bountiful granary: take stock regularly",story:"With Tian Fu in your Health palace, your constitution is steady, your recovery good, and you know how to take care of yourself. Tian Fu belongs to the Earth element, so keep an eye on digestion and overeating. {{B:天府:You keep yourself in good shape.|Comfort can easily lead you to neglect exercise.}}",scenes:["Your fridge is always packed, and you can't help grabbing one more snack.","You might feel healthy and push your annual checkup off until next year."],advice:"Walk or stretch at a fixed time every day, watch your portions, and get checkups on schedule."},
'太陰':{title:"The moon's tides: good sleep is the best care",story:"With Tai Yin in your Health palace, your body is delicate and sensitive, and the ups and downs of your routine and mood show up physically. Keep an eye on sleep, hormonal balance, and your kidneys and urinary system. {{B:太陰:Your body regulates itself well.|You need a stable routine all the more to settle body and mind.}}",scenes:["When work gets busy and you go to bed late, your skin and energy are noticeably worse for days after.","You might feel the cold especially, with icy hands and feet all winter, needing a hot drink to warm up."],advice:"Treat sleep as your most important form of care: go to bed at a fixed time and stay away from screens before sleep."},
'貪狼':{title:"An energetic hunter needs to come home to the nest",story:"With Tan Lang in your Health palace, you're full of energy and appetite and love new thrills. Keep an eye on the load on your liver and kidneys, irregular hours, and your appetite for food and drink. {{B:貪狼:You're physically strong and recover quickly.|Too much play and indulgence can more easily pile up fatigue.}}",scenes:["When you discover a new restaurant, you go back several days in a row.","You might start a good series and watch straight through until dawn."],advice:"When you enjoy something new, set yourself a limit, so your body also gets a regular rhythm of rest."},
'巨門':{title:"Hidden pressure often speaks first through your stomach",story:"With Ju Men in your Health palace, you rarely voice your stress, and it tends to build up in your stomach and throat. Keep an eye on digestion, your mouth and the areas you use to speak. {{B:巨門:You express yourself freely and your stress has an outlet.|Things get bottled up, and your body protests on your behalf.}}",scenes:["Misunderstood with no chance to explain, you find nothing you eat agrees with you for days.","Your throat might be dry and sore after talking too much, or you catch yourself clenching your jaw."],advice:"Eat slowly and attentively, and talk through what's bothering you with someone you trust, or write it down."},
'天相':{title:"A steady seal, with stress hiding in your skin",story:"With Tian Xiang in your Health palace, your body is generally stable and your life fairly regular. Tian Xiang belongs to the Water element, so keep an eye on your skin, urinary system and water balance. You often worry about other people's affairs, and the stress tends to show in your skin or sleep; when Tian Xiang is well placed, you cope better.",scenes:["A friend's problem starts bothering you too, and a few days later your skin acts up.","You might forget to drink water at work and often feel parched and sluggish by afternoon."],advice:"Drink more water and keep regular hours. Listen to other people's troubles, but you don't have to carry them all home."},
'天梁':{title:"An old tree gives shade, but needs regular pruning",story:"With Tian Liang in your Health palace, your body carries a sense of protection: problems are often found early and pass smoothly. Keep an eye on digestion and the minor chronic issues that come with age. You're mature beyond your years and often care for others, but your tolerance for discomfort is too high.",scenes:["You remind your family to get regular checkups, while always saying “I'm fine” about yourself.","When your stomach feels off, you might just put up with it and sip some warm water."],advice:"Swap “I'm fine” for “I'll get it checked,” and book a checkup every year."},
'七殺':{title:"A lone warrior's body needs resupplying",story:"With Qi Sha in your Health palace, you have strong stamina and willpower and give everything your all. Qi Sha belongs to the Metal element, so keep an eye on your airways, lungs, and strains or bumps during exercise or work. {{B:七殺:Your endurance is excellent.|You can more easily ignore warning signs while pushing hard.}}",scenes:["You're used to carrying heavy things and fixing stuff alone, and often find small bruises with no idea where they came from.","You might insist on working out with a cold, thinking a good sweat will fix it."],advice:"Rest properly when you're sick, warm up before exercise, and wear protection when you work."},
'破軍':{title:"A city forever rebuilding: budget your energy",story:"With Po Jun in your Health palace, your pace of life changes often, and your body can swing between strong and weak as a result. Po Jun belongs to the Water element, so keep an eye on your urinary system, energy drain and overwork. {{B:破軍:You have great drive and recover quickly.|You need a stable routine all the more.}}",scenes:["A month of back-to-back business trips and a move, and as soon as it's over you fall ill.","You might cycle through several kinds of exercise in short bursts of enthusiasm without sticking to any."],advice:"Find a simple exercise you can keep up. Don't chase excitement; just keep doing it steadily."},
'空':{title:"A borrowed mirror: your surroundings shape your constitution",story:"When your Health palace has no major star, your physical tendencies are often read from the opposite palace, and you're especially influenced by your living environment and the people around you. When you live well, eat well and get on with people, your energy is good; when your surroundings are chaotic, your body follows. You're flexible and adjust quickly.",scenes:["After moving to a job with regular hours, you notice you look visibly healthier.","Sharing a place with a roommate who stays up late, you might start going to bed late too without realizing it."],advice:"Shape your living environment on purpose and keep company with people who have good habits; your body will steady along with it."}
},
'福德':{
'紫微':{title:"A discerning monarch lives in your heart",story:"With Zi Wei in your Fortune palace, your inner world demands quality. You like refined pleasures, and your store of good fortune runs deep. You think a lot and aim high, often setting standards for yourself, and when you fall short it weighs on you. You need respect, and a corner of life where you get to be in charge.",scenes:["On a day off you'd rather go to a quiet, good café than squeeze into a popular tourist spot.","You might buy few things but buy well; a good coat lasts you ten years."],advice:"Let yourself be a little casual sometimes. Enjoyment doesn't have to be perfect to count."},
'紫微·天府':{title:"A rich inner storehouse, and pleasure is better shared",story:"With Zi Wei and Tian Fu in your Fortune palace, your good fortune is substantial; you know how to live and have the means to make yourself comfortable. Your inner world is stable, and you value security and taste. Your thinking leans conservative, though, and you tend to carry what's on your mind alone, rarely letting others see.",scenes:["You keep your home like a small boutique hotel and feel content spending the weekend in.","You might save steadily, yet rarely let yourself spend money purely on joy."],advice:"Each year, plan one expense that's purely for happiness, not for practicality."},
'紫微·天相':{title:"A composed heart that needs a little willfulness",story:"With Zi Wei and Tian Xiang in your Fortune palace, your state of mind is steady; you value order and propriety, and your pleasures lean refined and tasteful. You care a lot about how others feel and often put your own needs last, so some resentment inevitably builds up.",scenes:["When friends go out to eat, you're always the one booking the table and splitting the bill, and you eat in a hurry.","You might love wandering through art museums and picking out beautiful stationery, finding calm in the details."],advice:"Each week, keep some time that follows only your own preferences, without worrying what anyone thinks."},
'紫微·破軍':{title:"An urge inside to remake the world",story:"With Zi Wei and Po Jun in your Fortune palace, your heart won't settle for the ordinary. You like change and challenge, and your joy comes from breakthroughs. Your ideas are bold, and you often want to overhaul your life. But your mood swings a lot, and excitement can be followed by emptiness.",scenes:["You might suddenly decide to learn scuba diving or sign up for an adventure trip.","You might rearrange your room again and again, and each time feel the thrill of a fresh start."],advice:"Break the urge for change into small steps and finish one at a time; the satisfaction lasts longer."},
'紫微·七殺':{title:"An unyielding spirit that must learn to stand down",story:"With Zi Wei and Qi Sha in your Fortune palace, your mental strength is great, and you like things with goals and challenges. You find it hard to truly relax, and even on holiday you want to accomplish something. Inside you're a bit aloof and tend to carry stress alone.",scenes:["Even on vacation you set yourself targets, like finishing three books in a week.","You might be especially competitive in games or sports and want a rematch every time you lose."],advice:"Try a hobby where there's no winning or losing, like walking or gardening, so your mind can really rest."},
'紫微·貪狼':{title:"A fun-loving monarch with wide and refined interests",story:"With Zi Wei and Tan Lang in your Fortune palace, you know how to enjoy life, and your interests are broad: food, art and socializing all make you happy. You have both desire and taste, and enjoy pursuing a rich life. With so many interests, though, your mind sometimes can't settle.",scenes:["You might be learning mixology, photography and tea tasting at the same time, taking each seriously.","You might pack three get-togethers into one weekend and feel a little empty when you get home."],advice:"Choose one or two of your many interests to go deep in. Depth will bring you a more grounded happiness."},
'天機':{title:"A thinking machine that can't switch off",story:"With Tian Ji in your Fortune palace, your mind is very active, and your interests lean toward thinking, learning and research. Your mental pleasure comes from figuring something out. But your thoughts move so fast that you're prone to worry and anxiety. {{B:天機:That quickness shows up as flexibility.|You more easily overthink and can't fall asleep.}}",scenes:["You might spend a whole night exploring a new app, getting more excited the deeper you go.","Lying in bed, your mind might automatically start planning tomorrow, next week, next year."],advice:"Find an activity that focuses and relaxes your brain at once, like jigsaw puzzles, crafts or meditation."},
'天機·太陰':{title:"A poet under moonlight, with thoughts fine as silk",story:"With Tian Ji and Tai Yin in your Fortune palace, your inner world is delicate and romantic. You enjoy quiet pleasures, and reading, music and writing all help you settle. You feel deeply and can be melancholy, and when your mood shifts you think a lot.",scenes:["On a rainy day you make a cup of tea and read a novel to the sound of the rain.","A song or a film might leave you feeling low for days."],advice:"Turn your feelings into a journal or creative work, so your sensitivity becomes a strength rather than a weight you process alone at night."},
'天機·巨門':{title:"A detective of the mind who gets to the bottom of things",story:"With Tian Ji and Ju Men in your Fortune palace, your mental pleasure comes from research and debate; you like exploring the reasons behind things. You think deeply, but you can also get stuck going in circles, with an extra layer of doubt toward people and things, so your mind rarely goes truly quiet.",scenes:["After a mystery film, you might read online theories until midnight.","After chatting with a friend, you might go home and keep turning over what they really meant by one remark."],advice:"Set a stop-loss point for your thinking. If you can't figure something out, set it aside and look again tomorrow."},
'天機·天梁':{title:"An old soul who loves to reason things out",story:"With Tian Ji and Tian Liang in your Fortune palace, your inner world is mature; you like thinking about life, philosophy, religion or psychology. You enjoy giving advice and find satisfaction in understanding. With so many thoughts, though, you sometimes worry more for others than for yourself.",scenes:["You might read psychology or astrology books and enjoy learning to read people through them.","Whenever a friend has a problem they call you; after the talk they feel lighter and you can't sleep."],advice:"Once you've given advice, let it go. Others have to walk their own lives in the end; keep your nights for yourself."},
'太陽':{title:"A sun inside you that wants to light up others",story:"With Tai Yang in your Fortune palace, your mood is bright and you love to give, enjoying the feeling of being needed. Your happiness is often built on helping others. {{B:太陽:You're full of warmth and positive energy.|You give a lot and get little back, and quietly wear yourself out.}}",scenes:["You might organize a class reunion on your own initiative, running around just so everyone has a good time.","You might help a friend out in a big way, hear no thanks at all, and feel a little let down."],advice:"Give without expecting a return, and also practice doing something for yourself that isn't for anyone else."},
'太陽·太陰':{title:"Sun and moon in one heart: sunny and cloudy moods",story:"With Tai Yang and Tai Yin in your Fortune palace, you have both passion and sensitivity inside; sometimes you're bursting with energy, other times you want to be quietly alone. Your pleasures are varied, and you need both company and solitude. Your moods shift faster than most, with more noticeable highs and lows.",scenes:["By day you hike and chat with friends; at night you only want to watch a film alone.","You might be excited one moment and have your mood change over something small the next."],advice:"Get to know your emotional cycle: go out when you need company, and be properly quiet when you need calm."},
'太陽·巨門':{title:"A heart that lights up the world with words",story:"With Tai Yang and Ju Men in your Fortune palace, your mental pleasure comes from expressing and exchanging ideas; you like sharing views and discussing issues. Your mind is active, and you have firm opinions on right and wrong. But overthinking can make you restless, and arguing with people drains you.",scenes:["You might write long posts sharing your views online and be delighted when people relate.","You might discuss current events with your family, get more and more heated, and regret saying things too harshly afterward."],advice:"Choose topics worth speaking up about, and once you've said your piece, learn to let go of winning or losing."},
'太陽·天梁':{title:"A warm elder's heart needs warmth too",story:"With Tai Yang and Tian Liang in your Fortune palace, your heart is upright and idealistic, and you enjoy caring for people and passing on experience. You like meaningful things, such as volunteering, teaching or sharing knowledge. But you often put others first, and your own needs get neglected.",scenes:["You might volunteer on weekends and come home tired but fulfilled.","You might love being a life mentor to friends, while few people ask how you've been lately."],advice:"Let the people around you have a chance to look after you. Accepting kindness is a blessing too."},
'武曲':{title:"A practical heart that wants enjoyment to pay off",story:"With Wu Qu in your Fortune palace, your state of mind is practical, you demand a lot of yourself, and your pleasures lean toward visible results. You find it hard to simply relax; even while resting you think about efficiency. Your good fortune mostly comes from your own effort, and the harder you work, the more grounded you feel.",scenes:["Your hobbies might be investing, budgeting or working out, because you can see the numbers change.","When you travel, you might plan a detailed itinerary and have an efficient trip that isn't very relaxing."],advice:"Try scheduling one outing a month where you don't measure the payoff, so your mind gets some blank space too."},
'武曲·天府':{title:"A solid vault: peace of mind is the greatest pleasure",story:"With Wu Qu and Tian Fu in your Fortune palace, your good fortune is substantial and you know how to build up; your pleasure comes from stability and security. You like a life with safeguards and think practically. But valuing security so highly can make you miss some easy joys.",scenes:["Watching your savings slowly grow gives you a grounded kind of satisfaction.","You might want to travel but keep putting it off because it seems too expensive."],advice:"Beyond saving, set a fixed budget for happiness, like a short trip every quarter, and spend it with a clear conscience."},
'武曲·天相':{title:"A sense of calm found within the rules",story:"With Wu Qu and Tian Xiang in your Fortune palace, you value order and fairness inside, and your pleasure comes from doing things well and doing them right. You like a regular life, and following the steps gives you security. But when you're too strict about principles, your mind is often tense.",scenes:["You might sort your wardrobe by color and feel especially good when it's done.","When you see someone break the rules, it might bother you for a long time."],advice:"Allow a little mess in your life, like a weekend with no plans, so your standards don't become a frame that limits your own happiness."},
'武曲·七殺':{title:"The struggle itself is your pleasure",story:"With Wu Qu and Qi Sha in your Fortune palace, your mental strength is great; you like challenge and achievement and can't sit still. Your happiness often comes from overcoming difficulty. But you're used to proving yourself through effort, so you rarely truly relax and sometimes feel lonely.",scenes:["Your leisure might be weight training, long-distance running or solo hiking.","You might take three days off and start thinking about work on day two."],advice:"Practice being at ease without a goal, like sitting in a park daydreaming, or taking a slow walk with no destination."},
'武曲·破軍':{title:"A doer who wants to break the mold",story:"With Wu Qu and Po Jun in your Fortune palace, you don't like being constrained, and your pleasure comes from change and breaking new ground. You're action oriented, act as soon as an idea strikes, and your interests change fast. But your mood swings a lot, and after an impulse you sometimes feel empty or regretful.",scenes:["You might suddenly want to learn motorcycle repair or woodworking, buy all the tools and get started.","On a whim you might buy expensive gear, use it a few times and put it away in a cupboard."],advice:"With a new interest, rent or borrow gear first and take a few taster classes. Commit once you're sure you really like it."},
'武曲·貪狼':{title:"Working hard and playing hard",story:"With Wu Qu and Tan Lang in your Fortune palace, you have strong desires and plenty of energy, throwing yourself into both work and play. You enjoy the pleasure that material things bring, and like socializing. But you want a lot, so your mind sometimes can't stop and true satisfaction is hard to reach.",scenes:["On the day your bonus lands, you buy yourself something you've wanted for ages.","You might say you need a rest while agreeing to a weekend dinner."],advice:"Pay attention to the feeling of “enough,” learn to stop when you're satisfied, and keep one evening for quiet time alone."},
'天同':{title:"A born star of blessings: happiness is simple",story:"With Tian Tong in your Fortune palace, the blessing star is right at home. Your inner world is gentle and optimistic, and you're very good at keeping yourself happy. A good drink or an easy show is enough to lift your mood. But when you love comfort too much, you can become lazy and avoid pressure.",scenes:["Your favorite weekend plan is sleeping until you wake naturally, then going out for brunch.","When trouble comes up, you might choose to watch a variety show first and deal with it later."],advice:"Enjoy simple pleasures, and give yourself a few small goals so life has direction."},
'天同·太陰':{title:"Gentle moonlight that needs to be cherished",story:"With Tian Tong and Tai Yin in your Fortune palace, your inner world is delicate and soft, and you enjoy quiet, beautiful things. You value feelings and love to daydream, and your good fortune shows up as small everyday joys. But you're emotionally sensitive and can easily be brought down by others.",scenes:["You might switch on a small lamp at home, play music and curl up on the sofa with a book.","A sad story about someone else might leave you feeling low all day."],advice:"Keep some distance between your emotions and the outside world, read less news that drains you, and protect your gentleness."},
'天同·巨門':{title:"Relaxed on the surface, quietly tangled inside",story:"With Tian Tong and Ju Men in your Fortune palace, you look easygoing, but inside you tend to think a lot, with extra doubt and unease about things. You enjoy good food, conversation and relaxation, but when a knot inside won't loosen, nothing feels fun.",scenes:["You're having a great time out, and on the way home you suddenly remember something you didn't handle well.","You might love venting to friends, and only feel at ease after you've talked it out."],advice:"When something's on your mind, tell someone you trust. Don't let it ferment inside for too long."},
'天同·天梁':{title:"An unhurried old soul whose good fortune arrives slowly",story:"With Tian Tong and Tian Liang in your Fortune palace, your inner world is calm. You enjoy a slow pace of life: tea, reading, talking about life with people. You have a peaceful, noncompetitive kind of luck and often come through trouble unharmed. But when life gets too easy, you can lack drive.",scenes:["Your favorite afternoon is spent in an old teahouse listening to elders tell stories.","Facing pressure, you might habitually say, “It'll work itself out.”"],advice:"While enjoying the slow life, keep one small dream you want to make come true."},
'廉貞':{title:"A burning fire inside",story:"With Lian Zhen in your Fortune palace, your feelings are intense and your thoughts complex, and you're sensitive to both beauty and excitement. Your pleasures lean toward art, entertainment or things with a hint of risk. But your emotions tend to smolder, and when your thoughts crowd in, it's hard to find calm.",scenes:["You might love exhibitions and live performances, and stay moved by a single image for a long time.","When something bothers you, you might not say it, yet go over it again and again late at night."],advice:"Find an outlet that keeps your emotions moving, like exercise, singing or making something."},
'廉貞·天府':{title:"A refined heart with its guard up",story:"With Lian Zhen and Tian Fu in your Fortune palace, you know how to live, your pleasures lean toward things of quality, and your good fortune is solid. You're stable inside but keep your guard up with people and don't open up easily. You like being in control, and you like having your own little world.",scenes:["You might put real thought into decorating your study, the place where you relax most.","You might be polite over dinner with new friends while quietly observing them."],advice:"Give people you trust more chances to get close. Pleasure doubles when it's shared."},
'廉貞·天相':{title:"Finding freedom between restraint and rules",story:"With Lian Zhen and Tian Xiang in your Fortune palace, you value principles and propriety inside, and your pleasure comes from an orderly life. But you often tuck your emotions away; you look calm on the surface, while many thoughts go unspoken.",scenes:["You might find peace in tidying your room or planning an itinerary.","Something might matter to you a lot, yet you swallow it for fear of being rude."],advice:"Find a safe place to say how you really feel, like a bedtime journal or an old friend you can speak freely with."},
'廉貞·七殺':{title:"A restless heart that loves adventure and challenge",story:"With Lian Zhen and Qi Sha in your Fortune palace, your inner world is full of energy, and your pleasure comes from thrills and challenges. You find it hard to stay put and like things with goals and difficulty. But your mood swings a lot, and when you overthink you get worn out.",scenes:["Your leisure might be climbing, racing games or extreme sports.","On quiet days you might feel uneasy and always look for something to do."],advice:"Give your adventurous spirit a safe outlet, like classes with a coach, and learn to enjoy quiet moments too."},
'廉貞·破軍':{title:"Finding yourself between breaking and building",story:"With Lian Zhen and Po Jun in your Fortune palace, your heart won't settle for the status quo. Your ideas are fierce and your feelings strong, and your pleasure comes from change and breakthrough. You often feel the urge to tear things down and start over. But your mood swings a lot, and you need time to settle.",scenes:["You might suddenly get a completely different haircut and feel like you're starting over.","In the middle of the night you might suddenly want to quit your job or move to another city."],advice:"Sleep on big decisions, talk them over with someone you trust the next day, and confirm your direction once the impulse has cooled."},
'廉貞·貪狼':{title:"A colorful inner world",story:"With Lian Zhen and Tan Lang in your Fortune palace, your inner world is passionate and curious, and your pleasures are varied: food, entertainment, art and socializing all draw you in. You're very good at making life fun. But when desires multiply, your mind won't settle, and after the fun there's sometimes emptiness.",scenes:["You might go to several concerts, exhibitions and new restaurants in one month.","You might party all night and come home feeling a bit lonely."],advice:"Alongside the excitement, develop a hobby you can enjoy alone, like calligraphy, model building or cooking."},
'天府':{title:"A secure granary in your heart",story:"With Tian Fu in your Fortune palace, your good fortune runs deep, your inner world is stable, and you know how to enjoy life as well as build up. You like security, and your pleasures lean toward a comfortable home and good food. {{B:天府:You're relaxed and generous.|Holding on so tightly can make it hard to let go.}}",scenes:["You might cook a feast at home and invite a few friends over to eat and talk.","You might want a change of scene, but hesitate at the thought of giving up the familiar."],advice:"While holding on to stability, try something new now and then, adding some fresh seeds to the granary."},
'太陰':{title:"Gentle moonlight: quiet is the pleasure",story:"With Tai Yin in your Fortune palace, your inner world is delicate and emotional, and you love quiet, beautiful things. Your pleasures lean toward reading, music and decorating your home. {{B:太陰:Your inner life is rich and you're content.|You can easily get melancholy and think too much.}}",scenes:["You might light a scented lamp before bed and let yourself unwind slowly.","Gloomy weather might drain your energy along with it."],advice:"Create your own relaxation corner, a comfortable chair and a warm lamp, and go back there when your mood dips."},
'貪狼':{title:"A curious hunter: never too many interests",story:"With Tan Lang in your Fortune palace, your inner world is lively and curious; you like trying new things and your interests are wide. You know how to enjoy yourself and how to find fun. {{B:貪狼:You're multi-talented and life is full of color.|Desires multiply and your mind can't settle.}}",scenes:["You might learn baking this year and fall for surfing the next.","Your shopping cart might always have several things you want to buy."],advice:"Let one or two interests stay with you longer, at least half a year. Depth brings a different kind of joy."},
'巨門':{title:"A voice in the depths that needs to be heard",story:"With Ju Men in your Fortune palace, you think deeply and often add a layer of doubt and analysis to people and events. Your pleasure comes from in-depth research, conversation or good food. {{B:巨門:Your thinking is profound and full of insight.|You easily go in circles and find no peace of mind.}}",scenes:["You might research many ways to make a dish and feel especially accomplished when it turns out well.","Before bed you might go over something someone said that day, feeling worse the more you think."],advice:"Say your doubts out loud or write them down. Don't let them grow in the dark."},
'天相':{title:"A peaceful heart that finds calm in helping",story:"With Tian Xiang in your Fortune palace, your inner world is peaceful and loyal, and your pleasure comes from harmonious relationships and an orderly life. You're happy to help others and like seeing everyone doing well. But you consider others so much that your own feelings get shelved.",scenes:["When friends argue, you're often the one in the middle calming things down.","You might put together an outfit that's just right and enjoy feeling neat and appropriate."],advice:"Before taking care of others, ask yourself what you want today, then decide whether to say yes."},
'天梁':{title:"A mature heart that finds peace through understanding",story:"With Tian Liang in your Fortune palace, your inner world is mature; you like pondering the meaning of life and are often drawn to religion, philosophy or psychology. You have a protected kind of luck and often turn danger into safety. But your outlook is old beyond your years, and you sometimes worry too much.",scenes:["You might read books on life philosophy and draw strength from them to face difficulties.","Even when you're young, friends might love coming to you with their troubles."],advice:"Beyond understanding the world, let yourself simply have fun without thinking about the meaning of it all."},
'七殺':{title:"A proud lone warrior whose heart needs a truce",story:"With Qi Sha in your Fortune palace, you're independent and opinionated inside; you like challenge and find it hard to truly relax. Your pleasure often comes from reaching goals. {{B:七殺:Your mental strength is great and your will is firm.|Your mind can easily be overworked, with a heavy sense of loneliness.}}",scenes:["Your way of relaxing might be a long solo bike ride.","When something's on your mind, you might not want to talk to anyone and prefer to think it through alone."],advice:"Let yourself lean on others now and then. Meet a friend for a meal and catch up; being independent doesn't have to mean being lonely."},
'破軍':{title:"A heart that loves change and finds freedom in it",story:"With Po Jun in your Fortune palace, your heart won't settle for the ordinary; you like change and fresh starts. Your pleasure comes from breakthroughs and adventure. {{B:破軍:You're a strong pioneer with bold ideas.|Your mind is unsettled, and both pleasure and depletion run high.}}",scenes:["Every so often you might want to redecorate your room or try a different lifestyle.","On a whim you might spend a chunk of money on a new hobby that sits idle once the excitement fades."],advice:"Amid all the change, keep one unchanging habit, so your heart has somewhere to come back to."},
'空':{title:"An open field: whatever you plant will grow",story:"When your Fortune palace has no major star, your state of mind is often read from the opposite palace, and you're easily influenced by your surroundings and the people around you. With optimistic people you feel light; in a high-pressure environment, your mind tenses up too. You're very flexible and highly adaptable.",scenes:["A friend takes you hiking, and from then on you love spending weekends in nature.","In a chaotic workplace, you might grow irritable without noticing."],advice:"Actively choose the people and places that make you feel good, and your heart will grow into the shape you want."}
}
});
